This Terraform configuration creates an AWS Elastic Beanstalk application running Go. It provisions:

- An S3 bucket to store the Elastic Beanstalk application bundle
- A zipped Go application source bundle generated by Terraform
- An Elastic Beanstalk application and application version
- An Elastic Beanstalk environment using the latest available AWS Go platform stack
- IAM roles and instance profile required by Elastic Beanstalk
- A simple Go HTTP server listening on the `PORT` environment variable

